&lt;p&gt;Robots are safety-critical systems. Testing is not optional—it&amp;rsquo;s essential. Gorai provides patterns and tools for comprehensive testing.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id="the-testing-pyramid"&gt;The Testing Pyramid&lt;a class="anchor" href="#the-testing-pyramid"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex="0"&gt;&lt;code&gt; /\
 / \ Hardware Tests (1%)
 / \ System Tests (4%)
 / \ Module Tests (5%)
 / \ Integration Tests (10%)
 / \ Component Tests (20%)
 / \ Unit Tests (60%)
 /______________\&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;p&gt;Catch bugs at the lowest level possible. Unit tests are fast and pinpoint problems.&lt;/p&gt;
